itted images are rebuilt from the replays, never through the staged-version tracking, so `staged()`, `conflicts()`, `stagedVersion`, the entity lines, the index dump and the digest are all as they were; parked batches are not touched. A replay cannot be refused (the same batches on the same states); if one ever is, it throws a plain `Error` with the staged batches put back, or, when even that fails, still listed and the replica diverged, for the next replica to adopt them.
